# HELP sglang:hicache_backup_tokens_total The number of tokens backed up from GPU to local host DRAM (L2), by host pool (kv, swa, mamba, ...). Covers all D->H backups regardless of --hicache-write-policy. Distinct from the host-to-storage (L3) sglang:backuped_tokens_total. Every TP rank reports the same logical count under its own rank labels; read one rank rather than summing ranks.
# TYPE sglang:hicache_backup_tokens_total counter
sglang:hicache_backup_tokens_total{cache_type="UnifiedRadixCache",dp_rank="0",pool="kv",pp_rank="0",tp_rank="0"} 3584.0
# HELP sglang:hicache_backup_bytes_total Bytes backed up from GPU to local host DRAM (L2), all pools combined, including draft/sidecar transfers that the token counter excludes. Each rank reports its own KV shard; sum ranks for the physical total. A window's byte delta divided by the same window's hicache_backup_duration_seconds sum is the bytes-weighted active bandwidth; the plain rate is wall-clock payload traffic that includes idle time.
# TYPE sglang:hicache_backup_bytes_total counter
sglang:hicache_backup_bytes_total{cache_type="UnifiedRadixCache",dp_rank="0",pp_rank="0",tp_rank="0"} 1.97922816e+08
# HELP sglang:hicache_backup_duration_seconds Time taken to back up KV cache from GPU to local host DRAM (L2) in seconds, per merged write op. Covers all D->H backups regardless of --hicache-write-policy. Distinct from the host-to-storage (L3) sglang:backuped_tokens_total.
